---
const requirements = [
  "Claude Code instalado",
  "Node.js 22.12 o superior",
  "Cuenta de Google (para NotebookLM)",
];
---

<section id="instalar" class="py-20 px-6 bg-teal-900 text-white">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4" style="font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;">Instalar Jíntia</h2>
    <p class="text-teal-200 mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      Un solo comando. Jíntia se instala directamente en Claude Code y queda lista para usarse.
    </p>

    <div class="bg-teal-950 rounded-xl p-6 font-mono text-left mb-8 shadow-inner">
      <p class="text-teal-400 text-sm mb-1">Instalación</p>
      <p class="text-white text-lg">
        <span class="text-teal-400 select-none">$ </span>npx @charlie.act7/jintia install
      </p>
      <div class="border-t border-teal-800 mt-4 pt-4">
        <p class="text-teal-400 text-sm mb-1">Actualización</p>
        <p class="text-white text-lg">
          <span class="text-teal-400 select-none">$ </span>npx @charlie.act7/jintia update
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6 mb-10 text-sm text-teal-300">
      {requirements.map((req) => (
        <span>{req}</span>
      ))}
    </div>

    <a
      href="https://github.com/CharlieCardenasToledo/jintia#readme"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-teal-600 text-teal-200 hover:bg-teal-800 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-medium transition-colors text-sm"
    >
      Leer la documentación completa →
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
